{"articleNo":"990","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=990&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[취업] 2009년 교육역량강화사업 취업대비맞춤컨설팅 및 입사서류클리닉 시행 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2009.11.26","hit":"9763","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p align=\"center\"><!--StartFragment-->&nbsp; <span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\"><font size=\"2\">2009년 교육역량강화사업</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\"><font size=\"3\"><font color=\"#000080\">「취업대비맞춤컨설팅」</font> 및 <font color=\"#800080\">「입사서류클리닉」</font> 시행</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\"><br><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;□ 주요내용</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\">- </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #000080; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\">취업대비맞춤컨설팅</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\"> : 학생개인에 대한 1:1 맞춤식 취업컨설팅</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 44.7pt; TEXT-INDENT: -44.7pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\">- </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #800080; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\">입사서류클리닉</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\"> :</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\">입사지원서류클리닉, 체크리스트, 합격자견본</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;제공<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 입사지원(예정)기업체 중심으로 진행<br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;□ 일&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 정</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 제1차 : 2009. 12.&nbsp; 2(수) ~ 12.&nbsp; 4(금)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 제2차 : 2009. 12.&nbsp; 9(수) ~ 12. 11(금)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 제3차 : 2009. 12. 17(목) ~ 12. 18(금)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\"><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;□ 시&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 간 : </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\">10:00 ~ 17:00 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\">(점심시간 12:00~13:00 제외)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\"><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;□ 장&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 소 : </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\">취업정보센터 잡카페 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\">(도서관209호)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\"><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;□ 지원대상 : </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\">전교생 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\">(4학년 취업준비생 우선)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\"><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;□ 주&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 관 : </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\">취업정보센터 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\">(478-7211~2)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"COLOR: #353535; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼엑스포&quot;\">&nbsp;<font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp; </font></span><span style=\"COLOR: #000080; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼엑스포&quot;\"><font face=\"굴림\">* 취업준비생들은 적극적으로 참여하여 전문컨설턴트의 지도를 받으시기 바랍니다.</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;한컴바탕&quot;\"></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
